    <string name="privacy_body">RemDoc works only on this device. It has no INTERNET permission, no analytics, no ads, no cloud sync, and never reads phone numbers, call logs, notifications, location, contacts, microphone, or camera. Published by FoxDoC.</string>
    <string name="call_permission_rationale">After-call reminders need READ_PHONE_STATE only to detect when a call becomes idle. Numbers and call history are never read or stored. Unlock reminders keep working without this permission.</string>
    <string name="overlay_permission_rationale">Overlay cards require permission to draw over other apps. System Toast mode does not need it.</string>
    <string name="notification_permission_rationale">Reliable mode shows a minimal ongoing notification so Android allows a foreground service that listens for unlock.</string>
    <string name="economy_warning">On some OEM firmwares, unlock events may not fire after the app is force-stopped or reclaimed. Use reliable mode if that happens.</string>
